  title: TurtleHint
  displayTitle: Day3_1
  isViewed: 0
  texts:
  - key: body
    text: "Professor: This step is too high for us to climb.\nAssistant: And it looks
      like that flying creature isn\u2019t around either...\n[Loud Noise]\nAssistant:
      Whoa! Wh-what was that...? Professor, are you okay!?\nProfessor: I\u2019m fine\u2014I
      caused it. Seems this fruit can make a really loud noise.\nProfessor: Maybe
      we can use it to scare off aggressive creatures.\nAssistant: You scared off
      more than just the aggressive ones...\nProfessor: You\u2019re right. Look over
      there\u2014the turtle. I think we\u2019ve found our way to the platform.\nAssistant:
      That\u2019s not what I meant..."
